<hero component="ReferenceHero" file="tabs/patterns.tsx">
<title>Constructions that don't translate.</title>
</hero>

Each construction is a `ParadigmCard` (a TeachingCard with eyebrow "Pattern", `scheme="neutral"`, an icon badge and an info Alert holding the pattern note). Its rows are DB vocabulary, so the tables below show the shape, not a fixed list. Each quick test is a `QuickTest`.

