## Data Source

Dynamic content from database, loaded only when the tab is `patterns` by `loadPatterns` (a `createServerFn`) in `src/routes/reference/$tab.tsx`:
- `getVocabBySlug("phrases", ["phrase"])`, grouped by tag with `groupVocabByTag`: `name-construction`
- `getVocabBySlug("verbs", PATTERN_VERB_WORD_TYPES)` (`["verb", "phrase"]`), grouped by tag: `likes-singular`, `likes-plural`

The QuickTest examples and the ίσως / μήπως test are static JSX in `tabs/patterns.tsx`. This tab has no PracticeCTA.

